<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="eyebrow">IMAGE PICKER</view>
    <view class="title">从图片里取色</view>
    <view class="subtitle">上传图片后，点击图片上的任意位置即可取色；也可以一次获得一组主色板。</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="chooseImage">{{image?'重新选择图片':'选择图片'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{image}}" class="panel">
    <image id="sourceImage" src="{{image}}" mode="widthFix" bindtap="pickFromImage" style="width:100%;border-radius:18rpx"></image>
    <view wx:if="{{picked}}" class="picked-row">
      <view class="picked-dot" style="background:{{picked}}"></view>
      <view class="picked-info"><view class="section-title">取到的颜色</view><view class="code">{{picked}}</view></view>
      <button class="mini-button" data-hex="{{picked}}" bindtap="copy">复制</button>
    </view>
    <view class="section-title">主色板</view>
    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在分析图片…</view>
    <view wx:else class="grid">
      <view wx:for="{{colors}}" wx:key="*this" class="color-card" data-hex="{{item}}" bindtap="copy">
        <view style="height:120rpx;border-radius:14rpx;background:{{item}}"></view>
        <view class="code" style="font-size:22rpx;margin-top:10rpx">{{item}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted tip">点击色块复制 HEX。取到的颜色可以继续进入“创作”制作自己的色卡。</view>
  </view>
</view>
